# Supabase

## Mục tiêu

Supabase là một open-source Firebase alternative cung cấp backend-as-a-service với PostgreSQL database, real-time subscriptions, authentication, file storage, và auto-generated APIs. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, Supabase đóng vai trò là một rapid development platform cho các dự án cần quick prototyping, startups, và applications với moderate scale requirements.

Mục tiêu của rule này là hướng dẫn developers trong việc sử dụng Supabase hiệu quả, tận dụng các features như PostgreSQL với RLS, real-time subscriptions, và Row Level Security.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. PostgreSQL-First Approach**

Leverage full PostgreSQL power. Use advanced SQL features. Proper schema design. Indexes for performance. Constraints for data integrity.

**2. Row Level Security (RLS)**

Enable RLS on all tables. Define policies for access control. Test policies thoroughly. Combine with auth. Use service role carefully.

**3. Real-time Strategy**

Use real-time sparingly. Only subscribe to necessary changes. Filter on server when possible. Unsubscribe when done. Consider performance impact.

**4. Edge Functions for Custom Logic**

Use Edge Functions for serverless functions. Handle complex business logic. Integrate with external APIs. Keep functions small and focused.

**5. Database Migrations**

Use Supabase migrations. Version control schema. Test migrations locally. Handle data migrations carefully. Use preview branches.

**6. Auth Best Practices**

Use built-in auth providers. Implement MFA for sensitive apps. Handle sessions properly. Use RLS with auth.uid(). Secure refresh tokens.

**7. Storage Security**

Define storage policies. Validate file types. Limit file sizes. Use signed URLs. Don't expose public buckets unnecessarily.

**8. API Design**

Use PostgREST auto-generated APIs. Custom APIs via Edge Functions. Version custom endpoints. Document custom functions. Monitor API usage.

**9. Performance Considerations**

Use connection pooling. Optimize queries. Use prepared statements. Consider caching strategy. Monitor performance metrics.

**10. Testing Strategy**

Test database functions. Test RLS policies. Use local development. Create fixtures. E2E testing with test tenant.

